{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"SNG","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"雅歌","commonName":"雅歌","title":"雅歌","order":22,"numberOfChapters":8,"sha256":"4ea775fef238eea9a89952cfd99e138a86d4e67fc41ffa98bd302be908d54c4e","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/SNG/1.json","lastChapterNumber":8,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/SNG/8.json","totalNumberOfVerses":117},"chapter":{"number":6,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"你這女子中極美麗的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的良人往何處去了？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的良人轉向何處去了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們好與你同去尋找他。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"text":"我的良人下入自己園中，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"到香花畦，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在園內牧放群羊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"採百合花。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我屬我的良人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的良人也屬我；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他在百合花中牧放群羊。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["第五首"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"我的佳偶啊，你美麗如得撒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"秀美如耶路撒冷，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"威武如展開旌旗的軍隊。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你掉轉眼目不看我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因你的眼目使我驚亂。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的頭髮如同山羊群臥在基列山旁。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的牙齒如一群母羊","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"洗淨上來，個個都有雙生，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"沒有一隻喪掉子的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的兩太陽在帕子內，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如同一塊石榴。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有六十王后八十妃嬪，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"並有無數的童女。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的鴿子，我的完全人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"只有這一個是她母親獨生的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是生養她者所寶愛的。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"眾女子見了就稱她有福；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"王后妃嬪見了也讚美她。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那向外觀看、如晨光發現、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"美麗如月亮、皎潔如日頭、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"威武如展開旌旗軍隊的是誰呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我下入核桃園，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要看谷中青綠的植物，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要看葡萄發芽沒有，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"石榴開花沒有。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不知不覺，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的心將我安置在我尊長的車中。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"text":"回來，回來，書拉密女；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你回來，你回來，使我們得觀看你。","poem":1},"〔新娘〕",{"text":"你們為何要觀看書拉密女，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像觀看瑪哈念跳舞的呢？","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/SNG/6.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/SNG/7.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/SNG/5.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":13}